                                                     so their side effects happen for real
  init [--stack auto|node|python|rust|go] [--dry-run] [--force]
                                                     Scaffold REVIEW.md, PROGRESS.md,
                                                     CLAUDE.md, CI gate, lint thresholds
  install [--dry-run] [--dotfiles <path>] [--marketplace <path>] [--force]
                                                     Deploy the harness on this machine
                                                     (idempotent); ends by running doctor
  check [--fix] [--since <ref>]                     Run project quality gates (check-all; --since scopes lint/format)
  skills-lint                                       Run ~/.claude/scripts/skills-lint
  next [--json] [--force] [--peek]                  Print the one thing to do next, from
                                                     .specs/ and git alone (14 states; --json
                                                     adds the gates as data, --peek reads
                                                     without moving the loop counter)
  lint [<TASKS.md>] [--json] [--waves]              Check a TASKS.md against the task grammar:
                                                     [P] disjointness per wave, missing verify:,
                                                     ticks that no commit backs
  tick <ID> [--dir <d>] [--by user] [--sha <c>]     The only writer of [x] — records the newest
                                                     commit since Base touching the task's files:
                                                     (or --sha), never a claim; --by user also
                                                     answers a task whose files live outside this repo
  finish <on|off|status|check>                      Arm /flow:next --finish for the active spec (FINISH.md);
                                                     (check --hook is the Stop hook body)
  digest [--feature <d>] [--json]                   List what needs a human after an unattended run, from
